0..76 Comment "//! `circuit-feed-wheel` models a guarded feedback rule in a `theory` block."
77..80 Comment "//!"
81..144 Comment "//! `spin` feeds `out` back as `state` after one observed tick."
145..263 Comment "//! The pathological source refuses unguarded feedback. The running source refuses a model that states a circuit rule."
264..267 Comment "//!"
268..350 Comment "//! The checker reads `state` under the `emit` observation, which guards the loop."
